The *.webp files in this directory are unmodified whale-girl illustrations from
https://github.com/Sutera-Diffusus/dsh-whale-musume (assets/generated/dsh-whale-state-<name>.webp,
commit a37f3a4531004db412eb6dce8374cbc34d4a807c), used under its MIT licence, reproduced below.
They are used only to narrate the demo video (scripts/eval/edit-demo.mjs) and are not part of the npm package.

